@using Hoaii.Web.Services
@inject PageContentService Page
@* Câu chuyện trong từng sản phẩm — see design-specs/home/04-blog-and-story.md

   Figma node 1214:38902 is 1920×1080 with a 184×103 media frame (node 1530:39223) centred
   over the heading. The video file was given by the client; the reveal-on-scroll motion
   (replacing an earlier hover-to-grow version) was modelled on thecrafthouse.vn's "revealed
   image" section — a sticky-pinned stage where the video's clip-path opens up as you scroll
   through it, with a caption fading in once it's fully open. Driven by home.js
   ([data-story-banner-wrap]), which sets --story-grow/--story-hold custom properties per frame;
   story-banner.css turns those into the clip-path/opacity values. Falls back to a static
   (non-animated, already-open) layout under prefers-reduced-motion — see home.js. *@
<section class="story-banner-wrap" data-story-banner-wrap>
    <div class="story-banner" data-story-banner>
        <video class="story-banner__video"
               src="/videos/home-story.mp4"
               poster="/images/home/home-story-poster.jpg"
               muted loop playsinline preload="none"
               aria-label="Video câu chuyện trong từng sản phẩm"></video>

        <h2 class="story-banner__title">
            <span class="story-banner__title--desktop">@Page.Get(PageContentKeys.Home, "story_banner_desktop")</span>
            <span class="story-banner__title--mobile">
                <span>@Page.Get(PageContentKeys.Home, "story_banner_mobile_1")</span>
                <span>@Page.Get(PageContentKeys.Home, "story_banner_mobile_2")</span>
            </span>
        </h2>

        <p class="story-banner__caption">@Page.Get(PageContentKeys.Home, "story_banner_caption")</p>
    </div>
</section>
